    "#### 1. Introduction\n",
    "This project is a Hotel Reservation and Management System built using Python and Object-Oriented Programming principles. \n",
    "It allows guests to register, rooms to be managed, reservations to be created, services to be added, and final bills to be generated."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2eae2219",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 2. Problem Statement\n",
    "Hotels need a structured system to manage guests, rooms, reservations, payments, and additional services. \n",
    "Manual processes can lead to double booking, poor room tracking, billing errors, and inefficient guest management. \n",
    "This project solves that problem by building an object-oriented hotel management system."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "905460ff",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 3. Project Objectives\n",
    "The objectives of this project are to:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Model hotel entities using classes and objects.\n",
    "2. Apply inheritance using guest, staff, room, and payment classes.\n",
    "3. Apply polymorphism using different pricing and payment behaviors.\n",
    "4. Apply encapsulation to protect sensitive hotel and guest data.\n",
    "5. Implement exception handling for invalid hotel operations.\n",
    "6. Build a functional hotel reservation workflow.\n",
    "7. Demonstrate testing and documentation in a Jupyter Notebook."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7954d1e2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 4. System Requirements\n",
    "The system should allow users to:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Register guests\n",
    "- Add rooms\n",
    "- View available rooms\n",
    "- Search rooms\n",
    "- Make reservations\n",
    "- Cancel reservations\n",
    "- Check guests in\n",
    "- Check guests out\n",
    "- Add hotel services\n",
    "- Calculate accommodation charges\n",
    "- Generate final bills\n",
    "- Process payments\n",
    "- View guest history"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e21a5b71",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 5. Class Design\n",
    "\n",
    "The main classes in this project are:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Person -> Base class for people in the hotel system \n",
    "    - Guest -> Represents a hotel guest\n",
    "    - Staff -> Represents hotel staff \n",
    "- Room -> Base class for all rooms\n",
    "    - StandardRoom -> Basic room type \n",
    "    - DeluxeRoom -> Premium room type \n",
    "    - Suite -> Luxury room type \n",
    "    - Reservation -> Represents a guest booking \n",
    "- HotelService -> Represents extra services such as laundry or room service \n",
    "- Payment -> Base class for payment methods\n",
    "- Hotel -> Central controller for guests, rooms, and reservations"
   ]
